{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.UICFunctionalSelection"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven.uicAll_logRatio_sign_blind","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven.uicAll_logRatio_sign_blind","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/UICLogSummandEven.lean#L41-L51","doc":"**The block's total is blind to the sign of every block trace.**\n\nThe instantiation of `uicAll_sign_blind` at the displayed summand: flipping the\nsign of any subset of the final Markov traces leaves the content block's stated\ntotal exactly unchanged.  A functional with this invariance cannot implement a\nselection rule that reads those signs — which is what\n`gate_not_a_function_of_displayed_data` makes precise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven.logRatio_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven.logRatio_even","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/UICLogSummandEven.lean#L34-L39","doc":"**The displayed summand is even in the trace.**  `|·|` discards the sign\nbefore `Real.log` ever sees it, so `f_d(−τ) = f_d(τ)` unconditionally — no\npositivity hypothesis on `τ`, and none on `d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven.logRatio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.UICLogSummandEven.logRatio","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/UICLogSummandEven.lean#L30-L32","doc":"The summand displayed in `prop:unified-iterative-correction`:\n`ln|tr M_λ| − ln d_λ`, as a function of the **signed** trace. ","signatureChunk":0}]}